text = "All assets are from Open Game Art

Music:
-\"Cyberpunk Arcade 3\" by Eric Matyas www.soundimage.org
-\"Lunar Echo\" by Trevor Lentz
-\"Arcade\" by Trevor Lentz
-\"Hero Immortal\" by Trevor Lentz
-\"This Sky of Mine\" by Trevor Lentz
-\"Breakout Music\" by Mopz

Sounds:
-Purchasing sound effect by Spring Spring
-Wrong choice sound effect by DavidW
-Sounds made with Chiptune or Bfxr

Graphics:
Game graphics:
-https://opengameart.org/content/breakout-graphics
-Freepik
-Chad Wolfe
-NASA

Font:
-Flynn Nguyen"
vertical_alignment = 1

